WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.400
-Guys, I have some exciting
news.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.601
This is very --
a couple years ago,

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:06.467
I partnered with
Warby Parker, okay?

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:08.701
And I created Spinnies, okay?

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:12.334
Now, this is -- I was waiting --
So, like, when I wait online,

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.000
I always spin
my sunglasses around.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.868
So I go, "Why don't we put,
like, glasses

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:18.501
on, like, a ball
bearing or something on the end

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:20.934
to make them, like, really spin

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:24.467
so you can get, like, a good
kind of whip to them, you know?

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:26.200
So, we created Spinnies,
alright?

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.000
We sold out in four days.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.501
100% --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:34.334
100% of the proceeds
went to the Pupils Project,

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.734
which provides free eye exams
and eyeglasses

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.300
to kids in school.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.400
And it's amazing.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.234
It's the best.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:44.801
You're a kid.
You're at school.

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:46.267
You don't know why
they're not doing well.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.334
They come right to your school,
check all the kids,

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:50.701
and then they get to choose
from their frames, you know,

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:51.734
and makes it them feel good.

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.167
It's awesome.

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:56.501
Today, I'm announcing a new
partnership with Warby Parker.

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:58.133
-What?
-I have a new invention.

00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:00.467
[ Drumroll ]
Well, hold on a second.

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.200
-Oh.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.701
-I was in my dressing room
one night after this thing,

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:06.567
'cause it was a hit,
and I love working with Warby.

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.868
They're great.
I go, "I have a new idea."

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.834
Look at these.
They're called -- Can we --

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:12.734
They're called Flip --
There's, like,

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:14.167
a 180-degree hinge.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.200
-Right.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.200
-And, so, it's a black sunglass,

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.901
but they have
a fun color inside.

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:25.200
And then you flip
the arms backwards.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.367
-Backwards.
-And then -- Yeah.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:28.133
And then it turns back
into the other side,

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.334
which is a fun color.

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:33.734
-So you can be, like,
regular and a little extra.

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:37.367
-Yeah, yeah, yeah. Exactly.
They're called Flippies.

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:39.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:42.567
-Wow. Let me see.

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:45.434
-They're real.
Okay? This is real.

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:47.534
I'm unboxing.
This is an unboxing right now.

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:49.534
I'm opening up. Look at this.
♪♪

00:01:49.534 --> 00:01:51.567
Yeah.
-Ooh.

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:53.834
Snappy. Nice case.
-Flippies.

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:56.067
Now look at this.
Check this out, right?

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:58.300
They made these.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:01.000
So, you wear your sunglasses.
You're like, "Oh, that's cool."

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.133
-What?
-What's up?

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:06.501
You guys good? You cool?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:07.968
You take them off.

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:14.567
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:25.200
[ Air horn blows ]
Wow!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.634
Again -- Right?
You want to feel fun.

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:29.467
So 100% goes to
the Pupils Project, alright?

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:31.834
So not only are you
getting two pairs of sunglasses,

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:34.300
you're also helping a child
who needs glasses.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:37.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.801 --> 00:02:39.467
They're out officially
right now.

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:42.234
Everyone in our audience
has a pair under their seat.

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:43.634
-Whoa!
-Go ahead and check them out.

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:46.767
Open them up.
Yeah, check them out.

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:48.767
Open them up. Put them on.

00:02:54.834 --> 00:02:56.634
Do you have them?
Do you got them?

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:00.434
This looks like chaos.
Yeah. Look at this.

00:03:00.434 --> 00:03:01.734
-There we go!

00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:03.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:03.667 --> 00:03:05.067
-Everyone got them?

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:11.033
Alright, everyone turn --
everyone turn

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:12.934
