00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:14.200
-Black side.
-Yeah.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.634
And let's try these.
Put them to the black side.

00:03:16.634 --> 00:03:19.501
Yeah, flip them around.
It's going to take a little bit.

00:03:19.501 --> 00:03:21.334
Wait.
Look at how cool everyone looks.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.534
Can we get a shot
of the audience?

00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:25.067
-Whoa. Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:27.467 --> 00:03:30.534
-This is good.
Yeah. That's right.

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:34.334
Now -- Looking good.

00:03:34.334 --> 00:03:38.267
Now, everyone, why don't you
flip to the blue side.

00:03:38.267 --> 00:03:39.868
-Ooh!
♪♪

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:48.200
Hold on.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.367
Look at you right there.
Look at you.

00:03:50.367 --> 00:03:52.934
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.300
Get up! Come on!

00:04:06.734 --> 00:04:08.000
